 <br>Test/Reagents/Observation(s)</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>List - II <br>Species detected</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(a)</td>\n    <td>Lassaigne's Test</td>\n    <td>(i)</td>\n    <td>Carbon</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(b)</td>\n    <td>Cu(II) oxide</td>\n    <td>(ii)</td>\n    <td>Sulphur</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(c)</td>\n    <td>Silver nitrate</td>\n    <td>(iii)</td>\n    <td>N, S, P, and halogen</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(d)</td>\n    <td>The sodium fusion extract<br> gives black precipitate with<br> acetic acid and lead acetate</td>\n    <td>(iv)</td>\n    <td>Halogen Specifically</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><br><br>The correct match is :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"(a)-(iii), (b)-(i), (c)-(ii), (d)-(iv)"},{"identifier":"B","content":"(a)-(i), (b)-(iv), (c)-(iii), (d)-(ii)"},{"identifier":"C","content":"(a)-(iii), (b)-(i), (c)-(iv), (d)-(ii)"},{"identifier":"D","content":"(a)-(i), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iv), (d)-(iii)"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"(i) Lassaigne test is used to detect N, S, P, X element<br><br>\n(ii) Carbon and hydrogen are detected by heating the compound with copper (ii) oxide.<br><br>\n(iii) Halides are detected by silver nitrate<br><br>\n(iv) Sodium fusion extract gives black ppt. with acetic acid and lead acetate to confirm the presence of\nsulphur. "},"hi":{"direction":null,"content":"सूची - I का सूची - II से मिलान करें :<br><br><table>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>सूची - I <br>परीक्षण/रीएजेंट्स/अवलोकन</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>सूची - II <br>पता लगाया जाने वाला प्रजाति</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(a)</td>\n    <td>लासेन का परीक्षण</td>\n    <td>(i)</td>\n    <td>कार्बन</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(b)</td>\n    <td>कॉपर(II) ऑक्साइड</td>\n    <td>(ii)</td>\n    <td>गंधक</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(c)</td>\n    <td>सिल्वर नाइट्रेट</td>\n    <td>(iii)</td>\n    <td>N, S, P और हैलोजन</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(d)</td>\n